    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970413.0481\n\nWELLINGTON, April 14 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Iran recalls ambassador to New Zealand\n\n\n\n\nIran recalled its ambassador to New Zealand Monday, following New Zealand's temporary recall of its ambassador to Tehran at the weekend in response to a German court ruling.",
